u recommend one for me?" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_user_message_text" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[182,296][1014,539]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_content_message_container" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[66,605][1014,2400]" drawing-order="2" hint=""><node index="1" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_message_content" class="android.support.v7.widget.RecyclerView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[66,605][1014,2400]" drawing-order="16" hint=""><node index="0" text="To give you the best recommendation, it helps to know what device you use and what matters most to you, such as active noise cancellation, battery life, or budget.&#10;​Here are the top wireless earbuds available right now, broken down by what they do best:&#10;​Sony WF-1000XM6 (Best Overall)&#10;​Exceptional active noise cancellation that blocks out ambient and transit noise effortlessly.  &#10;​Natural, rich sound quality with high-resolution LDAC support.  &#10;​Outstanding microphone performance and reliable battery life for everyday use.  &#10;​Apple AirPods Pro 3 (Best for iPhone Users)&#10;​Seamless integration across the Apple ecosystem with instant device switching.&#10;​Immersive spatial audio, adaptive noise cancellation, and built-in fitness tracking sensors.  &#10;​Outstanding call quality and a secure, comfortable fit.&#10;​Samsung Galaxy Buds4 Pro (Best for Android Users)&#10;​Tailored for Samsung and Android devices with robust sound separation.&#10;​Upgraded active noise cancellation and convenient smart features like head gesture controls.  &#10;​Comfortable, sleek design built for all-day wear.&#10;​CMF Buds 2 Plus (Best Budget Pick)&#10;​Impressive audio performance and active noise cancellation well under the $100 mark.&#10;​Great battery life, personalized audio profiles, and LDAC support.&#10;​Perfect if you want premium everyday features on a tighter budget.  &#10;​If you are trying to choose between them, here is a quick look at how their main strengths compare:&#10;​Sony WF-1000XM6 focuses on industry-leading noise cancellation and audiophile-grade detail across any device.  &#10;​Apple AirPods Pro 3 prioritizes ecosystem convenience, intuitive touch controls, and health-monitoring features for iOS users.&#10;​CMF Buds 2 Plus focuses on maximizing value by keeping core features like ANC and strong battery life affordable.  &#10;​What kind of phone do you use, and do you have a specific budget in mind?" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_text" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[66,616][1014,2400]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node></node></node></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_chat_history_footer" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc=""